    {
      "name": "best_url_skips_invalid_top_url",
      "description": "The resolver is untrusted. When higher-weight results carry hostile or malformed URLs, best_url falls through to the highest-weight valid http(s) URL instead of returning null, and resolution_results leaves the invalid entries out. The list covers parser-disagreement cases (http:evil, http:///evil, a backslash authority) that a WHATWG parser would accept.",
      "category": "edge_case",
